SUMMARY:Cruise to the Site of the Clotilda Wreck from Historic Blakeley
DESCRIPTION:Historic Blakeley State Park runs a cruise to the wreck site o
 f the Clotilda\, the last known ship to bring enslaved Africans into the 
 United States\, which rests in the Mobile River north of the city. The ex
 cursion is guided by Africa Town Freedom Tours\, a group of descendants o
 f Clotilda passengers\, storytellers and community leaders in Africatown.
  Guides cover the voyage\, the passengers' lives and the legacy that foll
 owed.\nPrice: from $27\nArea: Mobile & Baldwin County\nTimes: Saturday 11
