SUMMARY:Pensacola Archaeological Society lecture: Legacy Collections in Cr
 isis
DESCRIPTION:The Pensacola Archaeological Society holds its monthly members
 hip lecture in the classroom at the Florida Public Archaeology Network in
  downtown Pensacola. The November talk covers why collections kept for de
 cades are hard to reach and wearing down. It also covers how a 1970s coll
 ection is handled at UWF under current curation practice and new federal 
 repatriation regulations. Free parking and light refreshments are listed.
 \nPrice: not published by the venue\, so confirm before you go\nArea: Pen
 sacola\nTimes: Tuesday 11/10 · 7:00 PM to 8:00 PM\nChecked against the v
